sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Utilisateur
    participant Front as Frontend LoginPage
    participant AuthCtx as AuthContext
    participant API as AuthController
    participant Auth as AuthService
    participant Users as UsersService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Front: Saisit email et mot de passe
    Front->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>Auth: login(dto)
    Auth->>Users: findByEmail(email)
    Users->>DB: SELECT User with Role
    DB-->>Users: User actif ou null
    Users-->>Auth: User
    Auth->>Auth: Verifie bcrypt passwordHash
    Auth->>Auth: Genere JWT access token
    Auth-->>API: LoginResponse
    API-->>Front: accessToken + user
    Front->>AuthCtx: setSession(response)
    AuthCtx->>Front: session persistee
    Front-->>User: Redirection /dashboard
